msgstr ""
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.serialize` "
"und :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.deserialize` zu :class:`sqlite3.Connection` "
"hinzugefügt, um Datenbanken zu serialisieren und zu deserialisieren. "
"(Beigetragen von Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`41930`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:1005
msgid ""
"Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_window_function` "
"to :class:`sqlite3.Connection` for creating aggregate window functions. "
"(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`34916`.)"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_window_function` "
